Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.15,0:00:04.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 迪恩 你到底想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean. what is it you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法的牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer's cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.54,0:00:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆的灵魂被困在里面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's soul is stuck in that box.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.57,0:00:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抹去地狱的记忆我办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't erase Sam's hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.94,0:00:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可以将它隔离在屏障之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can put it behind a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些记忆可谓十分不愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasty, those memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.90,0:00:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想知道那些记忆会如何影响他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to know what they'll do to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡骑士说他能建一个屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death said he can put up a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.23,0:00:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱的一切你都会忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't remember hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.72,0:00:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要这样做 - 别碰这个屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't do this. - Don't scratch the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.13,0:00:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你本该告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have told me, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.53,0:00:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来就不该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't supposed to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.40,0:00:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经干的好事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对鲍比 对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Bobby? To you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.23,0:00:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 死亡骑士并不只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, death didn't just.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.83,0:00:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你灵魂放回来 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}shove your soul back in, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.37,0:00:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在你和你遗忘的那些事中间\N{\fnArial\fs30}He put up the great wall of Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.91,0:00:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,建立起了一道「萨姆之墙」\N{\fnArial\fs30}between you and the things that you don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.04,0:00:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好是相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And trust me when I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得的那些事能杀死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the things you don't know could kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没在说笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我得弥补过失\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have to set things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.05,0:00:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我得知道 我到底做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I need to know what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.31,0:00:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你不知道那有多危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't know how dangerous that could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.69,0:00:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告过你不要把灵魂放回他体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned you not to put that thing back inside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.22,0:00:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我应该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.97,0:01:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来告诉你当我碰到他灵魂时是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you what his soul felt like when I touched it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.61,0:01:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是被活剥了一样 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it had been skinned alive, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.34,0:01:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想要杀了你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanted to kill your brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.65,0:01:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该给他个痛快\N{\fnArial\fs30}you should have done it outright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:09.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:14.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（布里斯托尔 罗德岛 一年前）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.39,0:01:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,胳膊怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以坚持到我们出城\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll hold till we get out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.31,0:01:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别弄到大出血 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't bleed out, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.06,0:01:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, that's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.49,0:02:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.35,0:02:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evening, deputy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.27,0:02:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛克探员 维南探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Roark, agent Wynand,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,请先下车好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}mind stepping out of the van a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.87,0:02:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正要去办公室 有什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just on our way to the office. Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.49,0:02:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 我联系不到多布斯治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I can't get sheriff Dobbs on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.73,0:02:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我联系不到任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.86,0:02:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前和多布斯联系过 也许他刚好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We spoke to Dobbs earlier. Maybe he's just, uh …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.75,0:02:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.74,0:02:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 别这么大火气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, there's no need to get riled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.70,0:02:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们俩跟我走一趟吧 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're coming with me. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.14,0:02:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会跟在你后边\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll follow you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:02:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.58,0:03:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐我的车 否则就拘捕你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in my car, or you're under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.83,0:03:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要逮捕两名联邦探员吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna arrest two federal agents?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.87,0:03:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你晚上愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.73,0:03:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.17,0:03:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂喂 慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, just hold …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得也许我们该用更冷静的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think there were maybe calmer ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.74,0:03:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,来解决这事儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could have done all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we care?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.85,0:04:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第6季第13集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.70,0:04:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有消息称\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sources said.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.33,0:04:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,检察官正在决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}prosecutors were getting closer to a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否要起诉这名演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}on whether to charge the actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们坚决否认诉讼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they adamantly denied that any prosecution was in any…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.58,0:04:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在看什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.58,0:04:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解下时事 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to catch up. So…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.07,0:04:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去一年梅尔·吉布森真的是变化很大啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mel·Gibson really took a turn this past year, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.76,0:04:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者他是被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or he's possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.78,0:04:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 考虑下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.33,0:04:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚和鲍比通了电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I just got off the blower with Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.06,0:04:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.97,0:04:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么其他线索吗 关于万物之母\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got anything else on this, uh, "Mother of all" thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 都不可靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, nothing solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.01,0:04:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说目前很安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says it's quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,普通的安静还是暴风雨前的宁静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet like quiet or quiet like too quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.27,0:04:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥时候「普通」过\N{\fnArial\fs30}When is it ever just quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.87,0:04:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.19,0:04:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是什么 坐标吗 谁发你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are these, coordinates? Who's it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.27,0:05:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.32,0:05:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是布里斯托尔的罗德岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Bristol, Rhode Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,该地上周有三个女人失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}where three women disappeared in the last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.25,0:05:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然受害者像是凭空消失了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, the, uh, victims seemed to vanish into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.93,0:05:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是有蹊跷 到底是谁发的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be something. Who's the text from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.01,0:05:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 一直在给我发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It just kept ringing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.39,0:05:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到底几个意思 - 会不会是别的猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that about? - Could be another hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.04,0:05:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在寻求支援 丢给我俩一个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking for backup, throwing us a case?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.29,0:05:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道我见过多少猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows how many hunters I even met,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.65,0:05:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,再我和坎贝尔家的人一起猎魔的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}working with the Campbells, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.23,0:05:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得我们应该去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think we should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 就这么放下手头的事过去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, wait. We're just gonna drop everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,老哥 两分钟前 你什么事也没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, two minutes ago, you weren't doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从一个神秘人那\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got mysterious coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.16,0:05:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到了个通向一个神秘地方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a mysterious Mr."X, "
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.66,0:05:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,神秘的坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}leading to a mysterious town?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得这太诡异了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't throw up red flags to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.70,0:05:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.96,0:05:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那并不意味着我们可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that doesn't mean we.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.26,0:05:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,对那些失踪的女孩坐视不理\N{\fnArial\fs30}can just ignore a bunch of missing girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.08,0:05:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.41,0:05:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. We'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.78,0:05:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果事情变得很蹊跷\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if things get squirrelly,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就不管了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we dump out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.37,0:05:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.41,0:06:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.87,0:06:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怪物喜欢黑发的女人哎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, freak's got a type … brunettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.88,0:06:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个有点野性\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's got a little bit of a wild side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.35,0:06:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看她的眼神儿 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all in the eyes, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没\N{\fnArial\fs30}See it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.66,0:06:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 除了你那点深刻的洞悉\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, aside from your little deep insight there,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.31,0:06:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些女人根本没有共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}these women actually have nothing in common,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.48,0:06:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不同的工作 不同的朋友圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}different jobs, different friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.27,0:06:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}different everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.71,0:06:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么联系呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the connection?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.05,0:06:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 你来查清楚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Why don't you figure that out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:06:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去厕所喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go hit the Poop Deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.06,0:07:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是洛克探员吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Roark?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,能再见到你很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.20,0:07:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得我丈夫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you remember my husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.46,0:07:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 唐 - 当然当然 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don. - Of course, right. Um, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.13,0:07:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.60,0:07:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来是因为那个又开始了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're back 'cause it started again, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些失踪事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}The disappearances?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的是的 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah. Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.02,0:07:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们俩听到什么消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…So, if either of you two hear anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.11,0:07:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,请通知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}please let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.44,0:07:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的搭档呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.41,0:08:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,秃头的大家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big bald guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.83,0:08:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,维南探员 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Wynand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 维南探员 当然 - 在性瘾康复治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Agent Wynand, of course. Well… - Sex rehab.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.30,0:08:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说过恋物癖吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you've heard of plushies, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.39,0:08:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位 这位是我的新搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is, uh … this is my new partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.17,0:08:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 幸会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing? Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 探员 我们该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, so, agent, we should, uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.73,0:08:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的是的 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.26,0:08:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 和你聊天很高兴 洛克探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Uh, nice chatting with you, agent Roark.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.30,0:08:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,铐住我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuff me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.07,0:08:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,咋回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看你那眼神儿也太饥渴了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just cougar-eyed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想萨穆埃尔和我来这里办过案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Samuel and I have worked a case in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.36,0:08:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用想了 就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.86,0:08:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我们赶紧撤把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.09,0:09:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 咱赶紧走行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on. Hop to, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.24,0:09:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能走 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't go, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.67,0:09:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.84,0:09:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 听着 五个男人在一年前失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, listen … five guys went missing a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.57,0:09:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体下落不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never found the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.73,0:09:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和萨穆埃尔肯定就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that's got to be the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来查这件案子的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}me and Samuel worked, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.91,0:09:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对极了 那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. What difference does it make?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.12,0:09:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年前五个男人失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A year ago, five guys go missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在呢 突然这些女人也失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And … and now suddenly all these women go missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么鬼怪在作祟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.96,0:09:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 要么我们没消灭它\N{\fnArial\fs30}So either we just didn't stop it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.53,0:09:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么就以为消灭了 其实没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we only thought we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但是为啥后来变了性别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but why the gender bend, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.81,0:09:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是男人 现在是女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}First it's dudes. Now it's chicks?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.47,0:09:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,犯罪模式完全不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a totally different M.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.89,0:09:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 鬼知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.61,0:09:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 那东西还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is, something's still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.71,0:09:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 打给鲍比 他能处理这事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Well, call Bobby. He can deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 我们自己也能处理啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? We can deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 猎魔人不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, there is a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.90,0:09:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复出现在同一个地方是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that hunters don't hit the same town over again …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.02,0:09:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们习惯一走了之 留下堆烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we have a habit of leaving messes behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 我承认 - 爸爸的规矩之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. I agree. - One of dad's rules …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,同一个厕所不能去两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}you never use the same crapper twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.56,0:09:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都会重复使用同一个厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone uses the same crapper twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.29,0:09:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.33,0:09:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我啥意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.50,0:09:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:10:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我 那个东西还在作恶 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}this creature is still walking around 'cause of me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.42,0:10:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我放走它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.65,0:10:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸还说过 要「善始善终」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad also said, "you finish what you start."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.77,0:10:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.69,0:10:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.89,0:10:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕我会随着记忆顺藤摸瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're afraid I'll stroll down memory lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.54,0:10:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后狠狠毁掉我脑子里的屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll kick this wall in my head so hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.73,0:10:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱的记忆就会破口而出 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}hell comes flooding through, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我一下子就精神崩溃了什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then all of a sudden, I'm some drooling mess on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.97,0:10:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.77,0:10:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 现在这里发生的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}But listen … what's happening here right now …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.47,0:10:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为我搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's because I messed up somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.19,0:10:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且后果还很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}in some big way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.13,0:10:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个失踪的人 每一个死去的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So every person who gets taken, every person who dies …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.65,0:10:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须阻止这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,换做是你也会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'd do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.38,0:10:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去查那些黑发姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll follow up with the brunettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.40,0:10:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去警察那里打探一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see what you get from the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和尼科尔做了很久的室友\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you and Nicole were roommates for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,从大学开始 但我们一直是最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since college, but we've been best friends forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.21,0:10:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个事情太离奇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole thing's really surreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.79,0:11:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的调查有进展吗 还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you any closer to finding her, or…?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.29,0:11:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会尽最大的努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing everything we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.93,0:11:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼科尔失踪那晚 你和她在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you were with Nicole the night she went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.56,0:11:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.64,0:11:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.31,0:11:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我给警察说的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like I told the cops …
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.97,0:11:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望能提供些线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish there was something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个哪儿来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.17,0:11:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个联邦探员给尼科尔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Nicole got that from that FBI guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛克探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Roark.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.43,0:11:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概 这么高\N{\fnArial\fs30}About … about yea high?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.66,0:11:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年的失踪者之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the men that disappeared last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.93,0:11:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,住在我们这栋楼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}lived in our building.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.47,0:11:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.92,0:11:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以洛克探员问了我们些\N{\fnArial\fs30}So agent Roark was asking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.89,0:11:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于那个案子的问题 我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}all questions about it, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.34,0:11:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.34,0:11:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 他来过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he … he came by here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.85,0:11:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 来过几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he came by a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.18,0:11:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}To, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,和尼科尔谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}speak to Nicole.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.23,0:11:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.89,0:12:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how would you…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}characterize their relationship?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,关系 不 他们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relationship? No, they weren't having a …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.86,0:12:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是 说话的语气啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the … the … the tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.19,0:12:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈话的性质啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the nature of their conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.70,0:12:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,声音很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.25,0:12:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.34,0:12:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有活力\N{\fnArial\fs30}athletic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.91,0:12:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands where I can see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.56,0:12:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,上警车 不然就逮捕你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in my car, or you're under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.65,0:12:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 长官 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look … no, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,请等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please just hold on for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一场误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been a misunderstanding here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.93,0:13:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 你真是傻逼到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you are dumb as a sack of hair …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.60,0:13:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,干了坏事还自己送上门来\N{\fnArial\fs30}coming back here after what you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.10,0:13:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这是一场误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there's been a misunderstanding here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.52,0:13:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不是个探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not a damn agent, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 联邦调查局压根不知道你 - 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The FBI never heard of you. - Just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.97,0:13:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.57,0:13:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲们想要安葬自己的亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mothers want to bury their loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.53,0:13:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.73,0:13:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,多布斯治安官呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's sheriff Dobbs?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.03,0:13:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.43,0:13:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离开这里时 浑身是血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You run out of town soaked in blood …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.82,0:13:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了逃跑 还把我的头打伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and you bash my brains in to do it …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.27,0:13:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还妄想让我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you really expect me to buy that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.46,0:13:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不记得了 你相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, would you believe that I don't remember anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.38,0:13:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿法官能相信你的鬼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But good luck selling it to the judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.49,0:14:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的丈夫出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to my husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.62,0:14:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I-I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.47,0:14:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.82,0:14:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.76,0:14:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是干什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.24,0:14:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.24,0:14:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.10,0:14:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我搞搞清楚 你们不是联调局的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get this straight … you're not feds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.19,0:14:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You actually hunt things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.23,0:14:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们知道这听起来很离奇 - 我看未必\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We know how it sounds. - I'm not sure you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.16,0:14:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 你到过事发现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw those crime scenes, Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.83,0:14:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得是个人类带走那些人的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think something human could have taken those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.53,0:14:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的那些是天方夜谭\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're saying … it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.93,0:14:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm sorry, I-I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这关她什么事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}what she's got to do with any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.02,0:14:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.11,0:14:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和我一起在警局工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}She works with me at the sheriff's station.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我的事情 也要告诉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell something like this to me, you tell it to her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.70,0:15:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你们需要我们做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, what do you need us to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.34,0:15:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的丈夫 他是那个治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your husband … he's the sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.08,0:15:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经是 直到他失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was the sheriff, until he vanished…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.05,0:15:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你也失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I supposed to think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.58,0:15:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西抓走了他 还是你杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-that thing got him, or that you killed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.44,0:15:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想知道到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想知道 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do I. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身上发生了一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.90,0:15:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得我来过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no memory of being here, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.74,0:15:38.15,Title,0,0,0,0,,这算什么 演《我们的日子》（NBC早期电视剧）吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this, "Days of our lives"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想告诉我 你得了失忆症么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling me you have some sort of amnesia?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.99,0:15:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我知道这些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I knew any of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还会主动跑来警局送死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}would I have stepped foot into this station?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.85,0:15:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't even know your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.65,0:15:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是某种游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is some sort of a game,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.47,0:15:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要么是聪明绝顶 要么是愚蠢至极\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're either incredibly clever or incredibly stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.19,0:15:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.64,0:15:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.01,0:16:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不知道你丈夫出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what happened to your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.84,0:16:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我能找出真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.10,0:16:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你真的了解我 你就知道这是我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you really know me, then you know that's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.66,0:16:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really don't remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.81,0:16:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I really don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.95,0:16:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是布伦娜·多布斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Brenna Dobbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.44,0:16:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenna…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.79,0:16:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你丈夫的事 我深表遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm sorry about what happened to your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.93,0:16:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我能找出真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can find answers…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.77,0:16:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,可困在这里 我束手无策\N{\fnArial\fs30}just not from in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.92,0:17:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来 帮我找点绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Help me find some rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.25,0:17:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要伪装成越狱的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's gonna look like a break-out,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.09,0:17:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得把我绑起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna need to tie me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.35,0:17:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.67,0:17:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐 不是时间越久 东西就越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boxed stuff doesn't get better with age, Don.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.04,0:18:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次逃亡的滋味怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how does it feel to be a fugitive again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.58,0:18:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不想说「不听老哥言」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hate to say "I told you so."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.97,0:18:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就喜欢说「不听老哥言」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You love to say "I told you so."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.87,0:18:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说对了 我确实喜欢说「不听老哥言」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, you're right … I do love to say "I told you so."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.14,0:18:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在野性妞儿身上发现了线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I found something on, uh, "Crazy eyes McGee."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.24,0:18:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你俩是旧相识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out you two knew each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.77,0:18:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.34,0:18:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说性关系 我刚和她室友谈过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biblically. I just spoke to her roommate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.98,0:18:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说 老弟你真是风流债满天下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to say, man … you really got around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有灵魂都如此 我真是服了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, soulless or not I'm actually kind of impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.74,0:18:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一个人失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missing person … another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.30,0:18:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我去 你呆在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right. I'll go. You stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.69,0:18:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.23,0:18:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 咋啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.18,0:18:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖乖呆在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.31,0:18:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道啦 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.40,0:19:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢您抽空配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.51,0:19:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.55,0:19:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是萨姆 请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Sam. Leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.01,0:19:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 接电话 该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, answer the phone, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.27,0:19:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到失踪女孩之间的联系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found the connection between the missing chicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.34,0:19:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们都和同一个家伙上过床\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all banged the same dude …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.90,0:19:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.93,0:19:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,短信 受害者 所有这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The texts, the victims, all of it …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.84,0:19:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是为你而设的陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a trap for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.89,0:19:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,回我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.57,0:19:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.42,0:19:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.62,0:19:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 请听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, p-please just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.67,0:19:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛比·哈里斯是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to Debbie Harris?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.59,0:19:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Debbie?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.01,0:19:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我放你出来 她就失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let you out, and she's just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.58,0:19:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为是我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And y-you think I did something to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.52,0:20:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, um, I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.16,0:20:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你丈夫整理的有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the case files that your husband made.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.35,0:20:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年失踪案的文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the disappearances last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.27,0:20:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,去警察局找\N{\fnArial\fs30}So go to the station and find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.09,0:20:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.80,0:20:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我溜进去找了 文件不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I broke in and I looked, and it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.87,0:20:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道是谁拿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have a theory about who might have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.77,0:20:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们的目的一致 布伦娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we both want the same thing here, Brenna.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.49,0:20:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想弄明白去年发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to find out what happened last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.84,0:20:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也想阻止现在发生的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we want to stop what's happening right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.59,0:20:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些文件在楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The file's upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.92,0:20:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.96,0:20:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.06,0:20:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一直都在旅行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you guys just travel all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.48,0:21:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻装上阵 常年奔波\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you just pick up and go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.54,0:21:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会很艰难吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't that get hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.38,0:21:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻时不算困难 觉得挺棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not when you're young … it's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.69,0:21:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦有了家庭 是有点艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you got a family, it's a little tougher.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.28,0:21:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩娜怀孕的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deanna got pregnant,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.05,0:21:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们手足无措\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we didn't know what we were gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.68,0:21:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Mary was…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.13,0:21:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是上帝的恩赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was a blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.99,0:21:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,车库里面还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more in the garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.01,0:21:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坐着 我去拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, listen, you sit. I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.79,0:21:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想念她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He misses her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们至少还有彼此相互依靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, at least you two have each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.53,0:21:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小时候和萨穆埃尔相处不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Samuel wasn't really around when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.66,0:21:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和他更多的是工作上的往来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have more of a, uh, business relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.86,0:21:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还有其他的家人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, do you have any other family?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.45,0:21:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人只会拖后腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family just slows you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.49,0:21:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.28,0:21:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.96,0:21:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.97,0:21:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.30,0:21:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 开始看文件吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…All right, let's see what you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.92,0:22:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,最大可能 这东西来自阿拉克尼（希神）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best guess … it came from an Arachne.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.27,0:22:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你见过吗 - 没人见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ever seen one? - No one has …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.58,0:22:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,2000年以来 没人在克里特岛之外见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not outside of crete, not for about 2, 000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.89,0:22:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那关于他们有什么记载\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what do we even know about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.99,0:22:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥都没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zip.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.35,0:22:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一些猜测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a bunch of guesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.08,0:22:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一个希腊瓶饰上的模糊画像\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a blurry picture on the side of a greek vase.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.80,0:22:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.13,0:22:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo ho, sea captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.23,0:22:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们不知道怎么杀死这个东西 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I gather we got no clue how to kill this thing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.26,0:22:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们尽力吧 看能不能歪打正着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we just go at it till something sticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.86,0:22:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 至少我知道它大概在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, great, I got an idea of where it might be, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.70,0:22:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,迄今为止 受害者都是30岁左右的男子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, all the vics have been men in their 30s,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.67,0:22:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,失踪地点都在半径2英里内\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they've all gone missing within a 2-mile radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.16,0:22:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们就去乱找一通吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we just get out and kick bushes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.43,0:22:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那纯是浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that'd be a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.53,0:22:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 这片都是郊区\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's all suburban sprawl …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.94,0:23:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少几百栋房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}hundreds of houses, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.69,0:23:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本是大海捞针\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.53,0:23:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 孤柳公园 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lonely pines park. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.73,0:23:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不如让这个东西来找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we make this thing come to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.44,0:23:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.89,0:23:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦娜 如果我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, um, Brenna, do you mind if I …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.13,0:23:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,借走这些文件几个小时 你不介意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I, um, borrow all this stuff for a couple hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.90,0:23:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, okay, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.10,0:23:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不记得罗伊了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really don't remember Roy, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.69,0:23:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.40,0:23:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经接受了他的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made peace that he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.33,0:23:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.85,0:23:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I just want to know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.37,0:23:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定他死得英勇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he died a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.18,0:24:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 接电话 该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, answer the phone, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.54,0:24:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到失踪小妞之间的联系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found the connection between the missing chicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.94,0:24:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们都和同一个家伙上过床\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all banged the same dude …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.03,0:24:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.19,0:24:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.21,0:24:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,短信 受害者 所有这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The texts, the victims, all of it …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.26,0:24:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是为你而设的陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a trap for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.37,0:24:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,回我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.74,0:24:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost shot you…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.76,0:24:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.97,0:24:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.65,0:24:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我估摸着你会来和她谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured you'd come and talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.01,0:24:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你呆家里的 老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to stay home, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.70,0:24:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到我的留言了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get my message?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.31,0:25:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 你不能在这儿呆着了 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We got to get you out of here. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.12,0:25:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道这个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do know that this is a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.39,0:25:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拇指行动自如\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a apposable thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.80,0:25:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有短信包月\N{\fnArial\fs30}and unlimited text messaging,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.27,0:25:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还知道它特别想杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we know that it wants to kill you specifically.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.24,0:25:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没落什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that about cover it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.39,0:25:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个阿拉克尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an Arachne.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.32,0:25:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东东\N{\fnArial\fs30}A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.40,0:25:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.94,0:25:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remembered?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.49,0:25:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y… I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.46,0:25:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记起什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what else have you remembered?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.60,0:25:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张好吗 和地狱无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, all right? I-it's nothing to do with hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.04,0:25:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 目前而已 - 迪恩 我能咋办\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh-huh. Not yet, anyway. - What can I do, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.08,0:25:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,记忆开始涌现 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stuff is just starting to come back, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.21,0:25:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这是自然现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.75,0:25:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要离开这 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're leaving. - No, we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.76,0:25:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是世上唯一的猎魔人 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not the only hunters on the planet, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.05,0:25:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以给鲍比电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can call Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.83,0:25:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他和鲁弗斯可以搞定这一切 - 怎么搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He and rufus could come and wrap this up. - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.26,0:25:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如你所说 它可能是任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you said, it could be anybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.41,0:25:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们一点线索都没\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we got jack for leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.66,0:25:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们知道它恨死你了 - 我知道是谁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We know that it hates you. - I know who did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.99,0:25:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是记不起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just … I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.99,0:25:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你不知道这事的危险性 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you get the risk here, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.24,0:25:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I do. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.09,0:26:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知不知道你每次去碰那个屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get that every time you scratch that wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.97,0:26:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是在玩儿命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you are playing russian roulette?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.56,0:26:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我知道你很担心 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I get you're worried, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.55,0:26:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道你在担心什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know what you think is gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.00,0:26:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是 该来的也拦不住 - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But you know what? It will or it won't. - Sam …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.23,0:26:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我开始想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm starting to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.17,0:26:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能在这里做过些坏事 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}that … that I might have done some bad stuff here, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.73,0:26:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不管是否有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so I don't care if it's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.16,0:26:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须弥补我的过失\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to set things right,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.63,0:26:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为现在我他妈有灵魂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I got a frigging soul now,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.80,0:26:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我良心不安 不会拍拍屁股走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and … and it won't let me just walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.89,0:26:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.12,0:26:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且我需要你帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I need you to back me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.54,0:26:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.90,0:26:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.03,0:26:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们寻找记忆碎片去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's "Memento" this thing, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.55,0:26:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来 是因为又开始出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're back 'cause it started again, right …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.24,0:26:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,失踪案了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}the disappearances?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.02,0:26:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是联调局的 你们是猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not feds. You actually hunt things.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.17,0:26:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不记得了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really don't remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.47,0:27:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在野性妞儿身上发现了线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, found something on "Crazy eyes Mcgee."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.54,0:27:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你们认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out you two knew each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.59,0:27:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.40,0:27:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.93,0:27:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.66,0:27:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时后孤柳公园见 谢谢 罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, lonely pines park, one hour. Thanks, Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.78,0:27:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.49,0:27:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.34,0:27:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉克尼一直在捕食三十多岁的男性\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Arachne's been snacking on mid-30s guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.90,0:27:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要符合它口味的诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need bait that fits the demo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.41,0:27:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太年轻 你又太老\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm too young. You're too old.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.32,0:27:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不是一般的老\N{\fnArial\fs30}89 and counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.46,0:27:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是认为该让罗伊了解整个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still think that we should have looped Roy in on the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.54,0:27:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得让他表现得自然点 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we want a credible performance, or don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.50,0:27:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果出了问题怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if something goes wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.69,0:27:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊不是小孩子 他会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy's a big boy. He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.35,0:27:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.95,0:27:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是 这不是我做事的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just… not the way I'm used to doing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.88,0:27:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.04,0:27:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到未来 老古董 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the future. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.58,0:28:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望它饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hope this thing's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.76,0:28:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分头找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's split up, look for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.63,0:28:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等 太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, wait. It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.81,0:28:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去找啊 - 他们走了 萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go! - They're gone, Samuel!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.69,0:28:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look … it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.59,0:28:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开了罗伊手机上的全球定位系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turned on the G.P.S. on Roy's cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.92,0:28:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,请说人话\N{\fnArial\fs30}In english, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.00,0:28:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论她去哪儿 我们都能追踪到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can track them back to wherever she goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.70,0:28:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又如何 你把罗伊当成炮灰了是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, Roy's just some redshirt to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.22,0:28:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛饵什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}just spider bait?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.54,0:28:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.33,0:28:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的备用方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my back-up plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.43,0:28:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 你和它们一样冷血\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god, son, you're about as cold as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.22,0:28:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.99,0:28:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.81,0:30:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,小可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.51,0:30:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.32,0:30:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't…feel…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.54,0:30:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 她在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy, hey, where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.59,0:31:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜砍掉脑袋才能杀死她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess decapitation works.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.56,0:31:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.18,0:31:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be okay. Just hang in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.74,0:31:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.39,0:31:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们马上把他送到医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, if we can get him to the hospital quick …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.11,0:31:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他没救了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He can't be helped. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.01,0:31:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不了解阿拉克尼 但我了解蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about Arachne, but I do know about spiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.54,0:31:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐居褐蛛可以一口夺命 这东西更厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}One brown recluse bite can kill you. This thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.38,0:31:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他们 毒液在慢慢吞噬他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at these guys … that poison's eating them alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.11,0:31:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是行尸走肉而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just dead men walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.82,0:31:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你的意思是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.86,0:31:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说给他个干脆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying we put him out of his misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.13,0:31:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.09,0:32:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了这个怪物能救很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing this thing saved a lot of lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.22,0:32:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这件事情你功不可没 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We couldn't have done it without you. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.33,0:32:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.89,0:32:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让尸体这样放着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just leave the bodies here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.93,0:32:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the gasoline.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.81,0:32:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么回事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.64,0:33:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.38,0:33:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.47,0:33:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么对布伦娜说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna say to Brenna?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.71,0:33:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.47,0:33:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 布伦娜 我是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Brenna, it's … it's Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.91,0:33:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是打个电话看你有没有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just checking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.26,0:33:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我可以过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, of course I can swing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.54,0:33:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Yeah. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.85,0:33:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.92,0:33:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想让我过去一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants me to swing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.47,0:33:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.97,0:33:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说没什么大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said it's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.55,0:33:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道她遇到大麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can tell she's in deep trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.99,0:33:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 后门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, back door.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.98,0:34:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.08,0:34:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那棚子里灯亮着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light's on in the shed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.19,0:34:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的蜘蛛第六感告诉我 有危险啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My spidey senses are tingling.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.35,0:34:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.05,0:34:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenna?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.88,0:34:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的对罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you did to Roy…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.07,0:34:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,做过那样的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.57,0:34:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答她 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer the question, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.58,0:35:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在看起来不错吧 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to admit I look good, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.74,0:35:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你留下的这个纪念品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, except for your little souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.65,0:35:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢了 我在你手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.64,0:35:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,放布伦娜走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let Brenna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.21,0:35:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟她没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has nothing to do with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.10,0:35:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come back around,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.28,0:35:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始跟我妻子往来\N{\fnArial\fs30}start hanging out with my wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.09,0:35:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还觉得这与她无关吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you think this has nothing to do with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.83,0:35:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 你觉得我无法妨碍你了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then…You thought I was out of the way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.04,0:35:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说 你他妈错大了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to say, you get a hell of a lot wrong, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.63,0:35:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你把我丢去喂的那个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that thing you threw me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.25,0:35:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为她是去觅食\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought it was here to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.51,0:35:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其实她是想繁殖 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She was here to breed. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.12,0:35:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她那时正计划繁殖下一代\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing was playing the mating game,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.46,0:35:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我符合她的条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I guess I fit her profile…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.58,0:35:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和那些可怜鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and all those other poor bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.78,0:36:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,被她咬后都变成了和她一样的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}She bit us to turn us into what she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.24,0:36:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你扣动扳机的那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time you pulled that trigger,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.35,0:36:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不是人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't human.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.03,0:36:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再是人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.57,0:36:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以子弹杀不死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So bullets didn't hurt me much.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.24,0:36:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,火也烧不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and neither did fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.17,0:36:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们离开后 我们逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So after you left, well, we ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.00,0:36:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我躲了几个月 快饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me … I hid for months, nearly starved.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.64,0:36:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我怎么活下来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what kept me going?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.67,0:36:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天夜里 我都梦到掐断你的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every night, I dreamed about ripping your throat out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.92,0:36:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是给过你明显的提示了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was sending you a neon sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.82,0:36:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}The text?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.37,0:36:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓走所有跟你上过床的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking all those girls you screwed?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.49,0:36:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在提醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was kicking so much sand in your eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.20,0:36:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不懂你怎么就不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't figure out why you weren't getting it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.83,0:36:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来布伦娜说你大脑受到创伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Bren tells me you've got brain damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.53,0:36:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.74,0:36:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伊 他们在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they, Roy …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.81,0:37:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些女人在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The women?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.36,0:37:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,随风消散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scattered…in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.00,0:37:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们现在跟我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're like me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.62,0:37:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了一个怪物 却制造了更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed one monster, you made so many more.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.17,0:37:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.06,0:37:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的问题是 我是杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only question is, do I kill you…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.06,0:37:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是转变你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or turn you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.26,0:37:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 罗伊 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Roy, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.24,0:38:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenna…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.96,0:38:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.78,0:38:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦娜 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brenna, I-I mean, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.61,0:38:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.56,0:38:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.78,0:38:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该回来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shouldn't have come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.91,0:38:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确实杀死了蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you did kill the spider man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.04,0:39:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 我做的那些都是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're suggesting what I did back there was a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.40,0:39:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是说 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm just saying … - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.15,0:39:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你得明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, y-y-you got to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.58,0:39:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年的那些烂事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that all that crap last year …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.35,0:39:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部的事都与你无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it … none of it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.82,0:39:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就说清楚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's be crystal clear, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.85,0:39:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.43,0:39:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想吃点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, can I get you anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.44,0:39:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你变成我的女服务生了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you now, my waitress?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.61,0:39:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想让你开心点 你个贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to make you feel better. Don't be a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.34,0:39:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.00,0:39:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 只是看起来还行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you look fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.78,0:39:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说一切都会好转的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I'm saying is everything's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.89,0:39:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.61,0:39:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我在这里犯过错\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I did this here,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.41,0:39:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道还有多少…\N{\fnArial\fs30}then who knows how many oth…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.26,0:39:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.70,0:39:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.51,0:39:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆 说话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, talk to me!
